# Trained model artifacts. Regenerable from the committed labels and code
# (collect -> engineer-features -> retrain -> promote, all seeded on
# RANDOM_STATE), and versions/ gains another copy on every promote, so
# these accumulate rather than settle. The labels themselves ARE
# committed -- those are hand judgment and cannot be regenerated.
data/models/

# The React build output, baked into webapp's jar. Regenerated by
# `docker run ... npm run build`; committing it would mean every frontend
# change showing up twice in a diff.
# Vite's output, baked into the jar at image build time.
springboot-app/src/main/resources/static/app/
